OL,5,G0932 Assignment
OL,6,     FChina once thought it had too many
OL,7,     Fchildren - now it thinks there are
OL,8,     Ftoo few. Its population is
OL,9,     Fdeclining. Micky Bristow looks
OL,10,     Finto what this means for the
OL,11,     Ffuture.
